  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shuttle Service as a Sustainability Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Having a second minibus will help take our kids to school and also generate some funds for our daily programs. The minibus will also be used as a shuttle bus to help us bring in revenue from our growing tourism business. We will be creating travel arrangements with hotels, tourism companies, other businesses and schools that need transport services. Profits from this business will be used to keep our youth centre sustainable and help it grow.</narrative>
  </description>
